\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang1055\ul\b\f0 YORUMUM:\ulnone\b0  Ya\'fea, varol arkada\'fe; eline, diline, y\'fcre\'f0ine sa\'f0l\'fdk! D\'fcnya \'e7ap\'fdnda deval\'fcasyon-katliam borsas\'fd (eroin kartelinden beter addedilip) yasaklanmad\'fd\'f0\'fd s\'fcrece, hele hele doland\'fdr\'fdc\'fd e\'fek\'fdya katil ka\'e7\'fdk-bunak Tanr\'fdTrump y\'fdlda birka\'e7 i\'felemle SP-hisse ve kripto al-sat borsas\'fdndan y\'fdlda $375Mr kazand\'fdm masallar\'fdyla, hala binler-milyonlar pandemi, n\'fckleer-deprem, soyk\'fdr\'fdmlar, sava\'felar vb borsa tezgahl\'fd katliamlar\'fd karc\'fdl\'fd\'f0a tedav\'fcl etti\'f0inden edece\'f0inden \'fei\'feinerek gururlan\'fdyorsa, asalak siyonist-yankinin hi\'e7bir s\'f6z-s\'f6zle\'femesi, insanca sa\'f0l\'fdkl\'fd ya\'feama spora sevi\'femeye hayretmez.\par
